    Consultant -->|Maintains profile, reviews opportunities, approves material| Platform
    TalentAdvisor -->|Collects opportunities, reviews matches, tracks applications, approves submissions| Platform
    HiringManager -->|Reviews approved candidate material and provides feedback| Platform
    SalesManager -->|Provides internal leads and client opportunity information| Platform

    Platform -->|Imports or receives opportunities| JobBoards
    Platform -->|Uses job posts and recruiter information| LinkedIn
    Platform -->|Processes client and recruiter messages| Email
    Platform -->|Reads copied opportunity descriptions| OneDrive
    Platform -->|Imports requests / future submissions| Portals
    Platform -->|Standardization, translation, matching support, CV drafting| LLM
    Platform -->|Generates CVs and application packages| Docs
    Platform -->|Publishes approved candidate material with access control and expiry| SecureSite
    Platform -->|Future client and opportunity synchronization| CRM
    Platform -->|Future submission and hiring-stage synchronization| ATS